B.NJ=A.a(s(["Use the footpath where there is no one. if there is no footpath walk along the right edge of the road facing the vehicles that are coming towards you.","If you are many people, walk in single (one behind the other) especially on narrow roads and at night.","When crossing the road, find a safe place to cross, stop at the edge of the road, look around all vehicles and listen then walk straight across the road but keep looking and listening as long as it is safe.","When crossing with the children, make sure you hold their hands firmly as you walk with them between traffic. Show them the safest routes to the shops, school and play areas, tell them the risk of playing on the road and running after moving vehicles.","Avoid crossing the road while texting or communicating or listening to music with your phone to  avoid being distracted."]),t.b)
