B.MD=A.a(s(["Never get into a vehicle that looks to be in a bad condition.","Never push others while getting in or out of a vehicle.","Never distract the driver with stories.","Never encourage the driver to speed or drive dangerously.","Never sit with your head or arm out of the window because you could be injured by a passing vehicle.","Never hang onto the outside of a vehicle.Never travel on the roof, because it is much more dangerous than inside.Never allow a young child to sit at the front or sit at the front when carrying a baby or young child."]),t.b)
