B.Q4=A.a(s(["Must hold a valid driving permit for the class of vehicle you are driving.","Must be feeling well \u2013 not ill or tired","Must be able to see properly \u2013wear glasses if necessary ","Must wear seat belt, this applies to your passengers too (front and back seats)","Make adjust your seat and mirrors so that you can see all round the vehicle.","Avoid wearing loose footwear, such as sandals and slippers, as these can prevent you controlling the vehicle properly.Must ensure that vehicle is in safe mechanical condition.","Must not overload with passengers or goods.","Must carry out regular safety checks before leaving for any journey."]),t.b)
