B.aeJ=new A.bi("Under this section, the learner is expected to have a better understanding of all the road signs, traffic signals.\n\nA learner should know all the road signs including mandatory signs, warning signs, information signs, roadwork signs, road markings and meaning of traffic light colors.\n\nThe IOV may randomly ask you any of the signs. The leaner needs to be well prepared for this section.",null,B.H,B.b9)
B.aeL=new A.bi("This consists of headlights, brake lights, turn signals and interior lights.\n\nIt helps the driver to see and ensures the vehicle is visible to others while on the road.",null,B.H,B.b9)
B.aeM=new A.bi("MEANING OF COLOUR",null,B.H,B.ah)
B.aeN=new A.bi("\nIt is marked by a white painted line.\n\na) White continuous dividing line \n\n --> means no overtaking or changing of lanes.\n\nb) Broken / dotted dividing line \n\n --> It means that you may overtake or change lanes if the road is clear/ safe.",null,B.H,B.aI)
B.aeO=new A.bi("This consists of fuel tank, fuel pump, fuel filter and Injection.\n\nIt is responsible for storing and circulating fuel to the engine.",null,B.H,B.b9)
B.aeP=new A.bi("This consists of the radiator, water pump, coolant, thermostat, fan.\n\nIt keeps the engine from overheating to ensure smooth operation and longevity.",null,B.H,B.b9)
