B.aeR=new A.bi("\n*Rules for angle parking*",null,B.H,B.b_)
B.aeS=new A.bi("This consists of battery, wires, fuses and alternator.\n\nThe battery supplies electrical energy to all parts of a vehicle and the alternator charges the battery while the car is running.",null,B.H,B.b9)
B.aeT=new A.bi("This shape represents information or facility or guiding signs.",null,B.H,B.ah)
B.aeU=new A.bi("\nThese are also known as facility signs.\n\nThese signs are used to guide road users along routes, inform them about destination and distance, identify points of geographical and historical interest and provide other information that will make the road travel easier, safe and pleasant.",null,B.H,B.aI)
B.Bt=new A.bi("Also known as crosswalks, are designated areas for pedestrians to safely cross roads, and they come in various types, including zebra, pelican, puffin, toucan, and pegasus crossings.",null,B.H,B.aI)
B.d6=new A.A(!0,B.b,null,null,null,null,17,null,null,null,4,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
B.aeV=new A.bi("\nUnder this, the learner practically demonstrates their driving skills to the IOV.\n\nThe learner should pass the designated routes as instructed without knocking the barriers.\n\nKindly avoid panicking. Panic can easily lead you into mistakes and crashing.",null,B.H,B.d6)
B.aeW=new A.bi("This shape represents Mandatory signs if it is in blue colour or Regulatory signs if it is in red colour.",null,B.H,B.ah)
B.aeX=new A.bi("These are questions that you may not skip. One should get to know this information at their fingerprints otherwise you may be stopped from proceeding with the test.\n\n For example;",null,B.H,B.b9)
B.aeY=new A.bi("Under this section, the instructor may assess the learner if he/she is aware of the procedures taken to extend first aid to either oneself or other individuals incase of an accident. \n\nForexample, prioritizing safety by checking the scene for hazards, then assessing yourself and any injured individuals for injuries, calling for help, and providing basic first aid like controlling bleeding and ensuring breathing.etc",null,B.H,B.b9)
B.aeZ=new A.bi("This consists of springs and shock absorbers. \n\nIt helps in providing comfort during a drive.",null,B.H,B.b9)
B.af_=new A.bi("Car System refers to a collection of interconnected components and subsystems that work together to perform a specific function, such as the engine, transmission, or braking system.",null,B.H,B.b9)
B.Bu=new A.A(!0,B.b,null,null,null,null,15,B.v,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
