B.afa=new A.bi("This consists of catalytic converter, mufflers and tailpipes.\n\nIt is responsible for guiding away the waste gases from the car safely. It also reduces noise and emissions.",null,B.H,B.b9)
B.afb=new A.bi("\nIts a place where three or more roads join and traffic must go around a circular area in the middle, rather than straight across.",null,B.H,B.aI)
